# .agora/decisions/ is tracked since 2026-09-11: the decision records are the
# project's own (adr/0004) and both machines need the same set. This branch is
# pushed to the private remote only; when feeding the public repository, pick by
# path and leave this directory out.
# The project's own change log. Local by decision, not by oversight: this
# repository is public and its change record is not. See .agora/development/CR-LOG.md
# itself, CR-1, for what that costs and why it was accepted.
.agora/development/CR-LOG.md
.agora/workspaces/
# Scratch root for looking at the app by hand: an isolated config.yaml, its own
# control-plane database and a throwaway project. Kept out of the repository
# because starting the API runs startup recovery, which dispatches queued runs,
# and pointing that at the real database is the hazard backend/tests/conftest.py
# describes.
.live-test-tmp/
